 trying to stay busy too, watching movies and reading. Just hoping to find something that clicks.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 106}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "Yeah, I notice similar themes in both—like finding oneself or overcoming fears. Feels comforting.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 97}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "Feels comforting.", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 97}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261016T221610Z", "last_updated_at": "20261016T222606Z", "first_seen_session": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 3}
