{"node_id": "nd004", "text": "To feel accomplished", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.5, "confidence_raw": 0.5, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Friends posting about travels, and here I am, stuck in routine. Nothing much.", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 107}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Feels like everyone is having fun while I’m just... doing normal stuff.", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 103}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "I feel like I should be out there seeing new things instead of staying put.", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 97}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Sometimes I do, but it feels like they've found their path and I’m still figuring mine out. Maybe I just need to take small steps instead of big leaps.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 151}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Maybe I just need to take small steps instead of big leaps.", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 151}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "Yeah, small steps. Like maybe trying a new coffee place or attending a local event. It feels more manageable that way.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 118}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "It feels like a start, but also a bit uncomfortable. I worry if it's enough. What if I miss out on bigger opportunities?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 120}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Sometimes I do, but it feels like they've found their path and I’m still figuring mine out.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 91}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "I worry if it's enough. What if I miss out on bigger opportunities?", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 120}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "nothing exciting.", "char_start": 52, "char_end": 69}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "But sometimes, it feels like everyone else is having big, exciting moments while I'm stuck in my routine.", "char_start": 119, "char_end": 224}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "But sometimes, it feels like no matter what I do, it’s not enough.", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 133}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "But sometimes, it feels like no matter what I do, it’s not enough. How do people keep moving forward without feeling stuck?", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 190}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Not much, you know? Same old stuff.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 35}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "I've been trying to stay busy too, watching movies and reading. Just hoping to find something that clicks.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 106}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "I've been really drawn to the character in this sci-fi movie who doesn't give up, even when things seem hopeless. It's inspiring.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 129}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "Feels comforting.", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 97}, {"session_id": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "Last week, I just couldn't stop thinking about how one of my friends got to explore Paris. Feels like I missed out on something big.", "char_start": 108, "char_end": 240}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261016T221610Z", "last_updated_at": "20261016T222606Z", "first_seen_session": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000302-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false,